  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "门面 vs 引擎",
      "items": [
        "CodingAgentHarness.file(dir)/jdbc(ds,id) 只是把 CodingAgent 包进 AgentHarness；租约、写面、持久化全在引擎侧",
        "run/runTask/resume/deliver/runReady 全部委派给 harness；getGateway() 可直接拿到唯一写面"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "applyHarnessOverlay 注入",
      "items": [
        "budget→AgentOptions（maxSteps/wallClock/tokenBudget）；HarnessToolRegistry 追加 8 个 harness_* 管理工具",
        "HarnessToolExecutor 是强制边界：harness_* 转 Gateway 落账，业务工具照旧；HarnessToolInterceptor 保留宿主拦截器；systemPrompt 追加 HarnessPrompts.instructions(+resumed/+fidelity)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "切片状态往返",
      "items": [
        "open 解码 payload.codingSessionState → newSession(sessionId,state)；snapshot() → codingSession.exportState() 回写",
        "applyDelivery：按 wait.payload.callId 把 deliver 值回填到 MemorySnapshot 的 pending function_call_output / CodeAct 标记；APPROVAL 写入 HARNESS_APPROVAL_GRANTED 让模型重试"
      ]
    }
  ]
